    "title": "等 + event clause",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-prepositions-p05-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "等 + event clause",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "等 + event clause postpones the main action until that event. Distinguish this clause linker from the verb wait for an object.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "等他来了，我们再走。",
                "pinyin": "děng tā lái le ， wǒmen zài zǒu 。",
                "meaning": "We will leave after he arrives.",
                "audio": "3f662690a17f387b7ca27f358eb66261b83f150b26ab075374a8b90e7d4ee323"
              },
              {
                "text": "等雨停了再去。",
                "pinyin": "děng yǔ tíng le zài qù 。",
                "meaning": "Go after the rain stops.",
                "audio": "43bfc3fc9ebcb7167e5795763703c1c9edf60bed8ac74675d7537af1bbc83f20"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "等",
                "pinyin": "děng",
                "meaning": "when; by the time",
                "singleWord": true,
